<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $49 (FIM 223.66).</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $49 (FIM 223.66).</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia's A share ADR</p>
<p>closed up $0-5/8 at $49 in New York on Thursday.</p>
<p>Its Wall Street closing equals about 223.66 markka. In</p>
<p>Helsinki on Thursday Nokia A closed up 4.40 markka at 220.00.</p>
<p>Valmet's ADR (two shares) closed up $0-1/8</p>
<p>at 31 on Wall Street. The price equals about 70.75 markka. In</p>
<p>Helsinki, Valmet closed 0.50 markka lower at 70.50.</p>
<p>Rauma's ADR was untraded in New York on</p>
<p>Thursday. In Helsinki, Rauma closed down 0.60 markka at 82.80.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-0-680 50 245</p>
</text>
